    "anchor": "24.22",
    "summary": "During [Muster Armies](vsdata:core-rule/muster-armies), each **LEADER** unit may pick 1 friendly **BODYGUARD** unit [it can lead](vsdata:core-rule/forming-attached-units); they form an **[Attached unit](vsdata:core-rule/attached-units)** for the battle.\n\nUnless a rule says otherwise, a **BODYGUARD** unit can have at most 1 **LEADER** and 1 **SUPPORT** unit attached.",
